[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2621296363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102057#issuecomment-2621296363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102057","id":2621296363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cPc7r","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T10:50:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-29T10:50:11Z","body":"Please upload a minimal project to make this easier to test and fix, it's important to get all the details to investigate this","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2621296363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628830644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102057#issuecomment-2628830644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102057","id":2628830644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6csMW0","user":{"login":"mrkyee","id":35887438,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODg3NDM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35887438?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee","html_url":"https://github.com/mrkyee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrkyee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T07:34:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T07:34:32Z","body":"> Please upload a minimal project to make this easier to test and fix, it's important to get all the details to investigate this\n\n[mvp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18627796/mvp.zip)\n\nIn addition, I've found that this doesn't seem to be a bug.\nIn my MVP project, I noticed that when ChildRes inherits from ParentRes<T>, it won't be displayed in the new resource panel. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3594c584-fac9-4065-8f99-d3fe7ab332e3)\n\nHowever, if I first inherit from the non - generic class ParentRes, create the resource, then modify the code to inherit from ParentRes<T> and rebuild the project, this issue can be reproduced.\n(I'm not sure if you understand what I'm saying.)\nSo, I think this problem has turned into a feature: Can we support resources that inherit from generic types?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628830644/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381255047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102057#issuecomment-3381255047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102057","id":3381255047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JiduH","user":{"login":"ErnSur","id":32190237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTkwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32190237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur","html_url":"https://github.com/ErnSur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ErnSur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T12:20:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T12:20:02Z","body":"I also came across this issue and I pinned it down to this:\n```c#\nusing Godot;\n\n[GlobalClass]\ninternal partial class Foo : Bar<Vector2>\n{\n     [Export]\n     public override Vector2 Value { get; set; }\n}\n\ninternal abstract partial class Bar<T> : Resource\n{\n     public abstract T Value { get; set; }\n}\n```\n- Create Foo.cs file with the content above and build the project\n  - The `Bar<T>` needs to be in the same file as `Foo`\n- Create Foo resource\n- The \"This inspector might be out of date. Please build the C# project\" message is visible in the inspector\n- If `Bar<T>` is moved to a separate file, the warning message disappears from the inspector","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381255047/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]